after:
Save each labeled part in the named file. The three files form one program.
```go
// File: go.mod
module example.test/lesson
go 1.27.0

// File: helper/helper.go
package helper
func Label() string { return "review" }

// File: main.go
package main
import ("fmt"; "example.test/lesson/helper")
func main() { fmt.Println(helper.Label()) }
```
